msgstr "DVC 的签名时间。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:161
msgid "When the holder withdrew the link, if they did."
msgstr "持有人撤回链接的时间（如有撤回）。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:88
msgid "When the referral was made."
msgstr "进行转诊的时间。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:64
msgid "When the registration was captured, on the phone, possibly offline."
msgstr "在手机上采集登记的时间，可能处于离线状态。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:175
msgid "When the request arrived."
msgstr "请求到达的时间。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:107
msgid "When the verification ran."
msgstr "运行验证的时间。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:112
msgid "When the verifier last refreshed its cached copy of the trust list; a signer added since then fails with KidNotFound (<a0>STT-VER-006</a0>)."
msgstr "验证方最近一次刷新其缓存的信任列表副本的时间；此后新增的签名者会以 KidNotFound 失败（<a0>STT-VER-006</a0>）。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:177
msgid "Where the request came from."
msgstr "请求的来源。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:61
msgid "Whether the family holds vaccination cards from abroad."
msgstr "该家庭是否持有来自国外的疫苗接种卡。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:160
msgid "Whether the holder protected the link with a passcode. The passcode itself is never stored in the record."
msgstr "持有人是否用通行码保护了链接。通行码本身绝不存储在记录中。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:180
msgid "Whether the manifest was released (decision table TD.DT.05)."
msgstr "清单是否已发布（决策表 TD.DT.05）。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:134
msgid "Whether the schedule counts the dose (decision table TD.DT.03): only doses from a primary source with a national schedule code."
msgstr "接种计划是否计入该剂次（决策表 TD.DT.03）：仅计入来自主要来源且具有国家接种计划代码的剂次。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:179
msgid "Whose record was asked for."
msgstr "请求的是谁的记录。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:182
msgid "Why nothing was released, when refused."
msgstr "拒绝时未发布任何内容的原因。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:89
msgid "Why the child is referred: unverified foreign vaccination cards."
msgstr "儿童被转诊的原因：未验证的外国疫苗接种卡。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:111
msgid "Why verification stopped, when it failed: the input of decision table TD.DT.01."
msgstr "验证失败时停止的原因：决策表 TD.DT.01 的输入。"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:161
msgid "Withdrawn at"
msgstr "撤回时间"

#: input/pagecontent/dictionary.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<a0>J2 Discover and refer an unregistered infant in Country B</a0>: Read each DVC unverified (triage) ({code0}); Add the infant; save doses as reported ({code1})"
msgstr "<a0>J2 在 B 国发现并转诊未登记的婴儿</a0>：以未验证方式读取每个 DVC（分诊）（{code0}）；添加婴儿；将剂次保存为已报告（{code1}）"

